        [
          "5",
          "I think smartphone apps that record how well people sleep at night will become more\npopular in the future. It is useful for people to learn about their own sleep because\nsleep is important for their health. How large is the new pillow? Is it soft or hard?"
        ],
        [
          "6",
          "Yes, I think it is necessary for people to have a TV at home. First, a TV helps bring\nfamily members together. They can watch interesting programs and talk about them.\nSecond, people can get important information easily, especially in an emergency.\nThey only need to turn on the TV to watch the news."
        ]
      ]
